          <p>Our greywater management interventions foster <b>cleaner, healthier, and more water-secure communities</b>, particularly in water-scarce rural areas.</p>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>Enhanced reuse of greywater, reducing pressure on freshwater sources and improving water availability for essential non-potable uses.</li>
